PROJECT: CEO Media Agency — After Hours Podcast Landing Site
TECH STACK:
- React + Vite + TypeScript + Tailwind CSS
- Bolt Cloud PostgreSQL database (Supabase under the hood, managed by Bolt)
- React Router DOM for routing (/, /privacy, /admin)
- Hosted on Netlify (ceomedia.netlify.app)
- n8n webhook for submission notifications
- AWS Lambda for admin authentication

DESIGN RULES (NEVER DEVIATE):
- Dark theme ONLY. Background: #0A0A0A. No light mode.
- Text: #FFFFFF for headings, #E5E5E5 for body, #999999 for muted/placeholder text
- Display font: "Bebas Neue" (Google Fonts) — ALL section headings, always uppercase, massive sizes (4xl–7xl responsive)
- Body font: Inter (or system sans-serif fallback)
- Accent: Gold gradient via class "text-gradient-gold" — background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C9A84C, #E8D48B) with -webkit-background-clip: text
- Every H2 follows the pattern: white text + LAST WORD wrapped in <span className="text-gradient-gold">
- Section separators: border-t with subtle gold glow (border-gold-glow class)
- CTA buttons: gold gradient background (#C9A84C → #E8D48B), black text, rounded-xl, all caps, tracking-wider, font-bold (btn-gold class)
- Secondary buttons: outline style with gold border, white text (btn-outline-gold class)
- Cards: bg-[#0D0D0F], border-gold-glow, rounded-2xl, hover effects (scale + shadow)
- Inputs: background #141414, border #2A2A2A, focus glow with subtle white/silver
- Rounded corners: 12px on cards/inputs/buttons
- No nav bar on the landing page
- Max content width: 1200px (max-w-6xl) for landing sections, 640px for questionnaire

LANDING PAGE STRUCTURE (replicates digitalsocialhour.com layout exactly):
1. HERO — full-bleed background image with dark overlay + gradient fade, centered logo, subtitle, 3 stats row
2. BE A GUEST — flex row (image left, text right, stacks on mobile), H2 + body text + Apply CTA button
3. TOP EPISODES — centered H2 + subtitle, 3-column video card grid (9 cards), each with thumbnail + hover play overlay + guest name + episode title
4. SPONSOR THE SHOW — same flex layout as Be a Guest (image left, text right), H2 + body text + 2 buttons (outline + filled)
5. AWARD — centered social proof image
6. FOOTER — logo + nav links row, platform buttons row (YouTube/Spotify/Apple Podcasts), copyright

SECTION LAYOUT PATTERNS:
- "Mascot sections" (Be a Guest, Sponsor): flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 md:gap-12 max-w-4xl mx-auto. Image/logo container on left (w-44 sm:w-52 md:w-56 shrink-0), text content on right (flex-1, text-center md:text-left)
- Sections with mascot/image have subtle bg overlay: absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-[rgba(201,168,76,0.05)] via-transparent to-[rgba(232,212,139,0.05)]
- Video cards: <a> with rounded-2xl, border-gold-glow, aspect-video image div + text div. Hover: image scale 105%, play button fades in, border brightens
- Stats: font-display text-gradient-gold for numbers, muted uppercase tracking-wider for labels

CODING STANDARDS:
- TypeScript strict mode, functional components, React hooks
- Tailwind utility classes, custom CSS only in index.css
- All form validation client-side before database submission
- Data arrays (EPISODES, STATS, etc.) as const arrays at top of file, rendered via .map()

MOBILE (PRIORITY):
- Mobile-first responsive design
- All touch targets minimum 44px
- Video grid: 1 col mobile, 2 col sm, 3 col lg
- Mascot sections: stack vertically on mobile, side-by-side on md+

